  "title": "Royalty Pharma and Zealand Pharma enter into rusfertide funding agreement for $100 million",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY, August 12, 2026 — Royalty Pharma plc (Nasdaq: RPRX) today announced an agreement for $100 million in funding to Zealand Pharma in exchange for Zealand Pharma’s economics related to rusfertide (PTG-300), a potential first-in-class therapy for polycythemia vera, a rare and chronic blood disorder.",
